        "title": "Determining the Rank of a Matrix Given the Number of Pivot Columns"
      },
      "question": {
        ":question/id": "8fc5dff3-fc3e-5fa3-a053-0839fe9b1b3c",
        ":question/problem": "Let $A$ be a $10\\times 15$ matrix that has $9$ **pivot** columns. What is the rank of the matrix?",
        ":question/worked-solution": "We know that $\\text{rank}(A)$ is the number of pivot columns in $A.$ \n\nSince we are told that $A$ has $9$ pivot columns, we have \n\n$$\n\\text{rank}(A)=9.\n$$",
        ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
